{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 930,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17bf7f47fbda1fc9021d0d94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时若位于前方\n一段时间内速度提升。若速度能力极高\n则效果提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd057bec8ef5490053ac43097c3a39276f634c9cac3f48a8d05bdd8cfc1d4a0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f56e62b0510b11006dfc79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时向前突进。\n之后若正处于最后冲刺阶段\n则加速度稍微提升＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea5f142eaea8e9d0e2cc80f91c9c68ee4e3b5833c15534329e0724ffbb05727",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1b187b3b4b050217ebf8fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段大幅向前突进。\n若根性极高，则极大幅度向前突进\n＜先行・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "514b56d1a19c9f77a36e70f8fbae04d97b86510e320f11db4c960e06320fdf8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "112901221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d1afec588f03c84d431f70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘向前突进\\n发动技能时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc781fef5f6a7779947d1ff383a776af2d9c380e90955686f1abc032e87f74b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b5b3f5799d8609551b653c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量持久力使速度\\n极大幅提升，若在草地英里或\\n中距离比赛中发动技能且当时处于上坡\\n则微幅向前突进＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5358e355bfa147982bded26e2c468db214b41c9b57a7d62d5ce3487cb63aa267",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838ae33ca257bd6252029544",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘初期一段时间内向前突进\\n若是英里比赛,则一段时间内\\n大幅向前突进＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6440445f43e619aae63077706bf6a7c3c57a37cb63f328dd4ac1306ea6441893",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f55313a8dc4608649c22ee66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于中后方时\\n消耗少量耐力使加速度提升,若是英里比赛\\n则在比赛终盘初期更早时间内\\n消耗少量耐力使加速度大幅提升＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da64c9f137465074f4f92ab28dda526db7a6ff603bb1c2a3ecd2ffee07d7f98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50be85b2ca5342092718fb32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线\\n一段时间内速度提升＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9620a1c8ed36f142a816c8413dc51ed8e1a918213d212cc0843f825a405e1b78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f056b1d75876efcce94140",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段一段时间内向前突进\\n若智力有十二分高超,则提升技能效果\\n＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d10ba0b933a7ef97931818a976033d8660698e9a61a1ec234d2f0f4b149bfc89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:562f4d543c69bdfe07d5f1f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘初段处于前方时加速力提升\\n若为海外赛场的草地比赛\\n在最后冲刺阶段的直线上处于前方时\\n加速力提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ad71839455f40ea3036cfd748b6e2bb96ee8cd19d8479c4f8cd8644be85ab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed98c0886a981eea04c39e5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近比赛终盘的直线上\\n一段时间内速度稍微提升,若在海外\\n赛场发动技能时处于前方,则一段时间\\n内微幅向前突进＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "735aea02a208b1835c4f90d6ffe49f16ccd948372751b83dcb47e5ac2a9f55b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e806838c1b66e7a9094bd5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时向前突进＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4231eb9c6e6ca4192b320502f48515f56610258a02bb03eefc17b3476097021e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85959b6323b8b3324ecbc022",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m～2500m的比赛,若终盘初期更早时间内进行追赶,则加速度提升,未满足条件依然在终盘初期更早时间内提升加速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3155e7c71df3cd61e19c45236bc558987e079224bff9adb06d9ac663c0c440f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:578ceb55b699ce73b0e752de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘向前突进\\n此外在技能发动时若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "37068fb3969e58c78e23aa01b09c0e129a53f7ef0af8fb3f718be03f5b180712",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51990ff966fc2e7cd0ddf769",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘及以后的最终弯道及之后时\\n若人气第1的赛马娘发动技能\\n则在一段时间内向前突进；若智力\\n足够高则效果提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "05686b0d76eecf4299ab9cd1e54acedb6ddd0828c6294c11e1df41fa28a84a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8c7ba4aa6c7bba7e81d5693",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺的最终直线\n速度大幅提升\n若处于绝好调则消耗少许持久力\n极度提升<作战·居中>",
      "source_fingerprint": "45070bc8211efed4c0c4ee7c4202859951652eb366269d0de074b5a691cde0f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eed438756389d4f3fa29776",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘时略微向前突进，之后若在\n最终弯道以后有过试图超越的行为，\n在剩余400m以内且位置良好时速度提升<居中·中距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f3234a49254c983cb065e9d2107ab717eb9e97b1d17398d0997b3e54a226a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb7cac8677b175e4dbbf7ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段的直线位于中团时\n速度略微提升，之后在剩余1000m处\n持续一段时间稍微向前突进<居中·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa634d94a9d15c53ef173b2bf3af4a91aa675937939d6bb994ef3524a7d81e10",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113501221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ccfa474a23aa5582b8550f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘及以后的最终直道位于中团及以前时\\n提升速度；此外若已发动「圣女的试炼」\\n提升速度则稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "35725503824d9f7589455f1f448390c05a2c41730baed01c1f82814cfbf42e2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebdd3116655e8dd8333f9dda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下坡时加速度稍微提升；此外\\n若已发动「圣女的试炼」提升速度\\n则消耗少量耐力并稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4307ebc1c34eaa58f0d4dc8474cff6396bccd724b8b1935642a30d82dcbb8515",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b2a0049c28c13bbe7bbb1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘迫近时持续一段时间\n提升速度，若「大逃」已发动\n则效果改变，稍微回复持久力且\n稍微提升速度<作战·领放>",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a09a227a91da27dc6cd61104494b7446a6e9b2aed1e5dee466eb028720e06fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913addf919d1401c0d40f11e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "2000m以上的比赛，则在比赛终盘\n初期提早位于前方时提升加速度，此外\n技能发动时若在第2名以内则稍微向前突进<作战·领放>",
      "source_fingerprint": "52d80e0006362ebe00809efd70562442ffa3a91a57330b0b54443bfd2e3839a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "113701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a912d3b8c02b2114b9c39f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘的随机位置若处于前方\\n则速度提升,如果是2000m以上的比赛\\n之后在最终直线若位于前方\\n则小幅向前突进＜先行・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3ac6f3d6e85d84704084d8ed53a5ed562f6a5b7800404a197e39779adf40404",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cadba10edf187764d8e2cab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘初段的随机位置位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,之后\\n在最终弯道前的第三弯道的\\n随机位置小幅向前突进＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "226ece9568d1162741ecc881cbb47637ab708fe2f7ffced9f44c6cccbda78ccc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10fa1e3bbe1ecdc4773bd478",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘初段的随机位置位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升,并回复体力\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af2534f07d3e4cc4a367668a5833d5cbe2e8b9c2d00d7a21b5bfe9011d3a7df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114101221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa21144faae0a14e62a03734",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的直线上若位于中间集团以后\\n一段时间内稍微向前突进,之后\\n在终盘以后的最终直线上处于好位置时\\n速度微幅提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c55b986c9dbbff66ce5c1653715d5fd0451e9075dc350872847737e1550046c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489c12257fa3565f36b739c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前的第3弯道上\\n向前突进,若是中距离比赛\\n则加速力微幅提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7dd981ebcd88cb8ec76d1122958760d93ed20d075c93e531859b09332242fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ba68687a939b517bfa0190",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m～2500m的赛事中\\n晚出闸的时间变长\\n之后在赛事中盘初期\\n一段时间内速度大幅提升＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d2c3df45d9784554bcf40f24fbae4943ef08c54c842d0cc021e095d769453d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8656931739bf456ec3747ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m～2500m的赛事中,终盘\\n初段尽早大幅提升加速度\\n若在中距离赛事后半段完成超越\\n则再稍微向前突进＜先行/追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d0d9e9a42c8746319e87cbea63ae9312c00f4c3f14c5db3926f0c5255a4e9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "114501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e88846b595bbce4f7c1f877",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长草地・中距离赛\\n此技能为活动专用",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee59bfbcc6f75a0fcab0a2b1fcf3bc058dd694126615ca59c8f1e97934cd244",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1200011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0564b3e0d0d756a48826ac78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长草地・长距离赛\\n此技能为活动专用",
      "source_fingerprint": "4454977b542df19c470c2ad4212fc7c8bccbe043fe9821bc8702ce01ebd50bd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1200021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709bbb7bdc26987d14aa0f0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长草地・英里赛\\n此技能为活动专用",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a85692c798bdd9fe87d7c1202ff6b10a5f5d44f83b29dccebabb46b62bb5192",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1200031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ce30ba2205683dd8c3837b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长草地・短距离赛\\n此技能为活动专用",
      "source_fingerprint": "a81e435c174c275239570268a60bdce43b7d2b161e5aa9e46bc28060681ffd3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1200041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b836b7f5e2ba3064ca217d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长沙土・中距离赛\\n此技能为活动专用",
      "source_fingerprint": "40146ca935a6ca4fc56967650661ed7fcefb1eb583240fbb63bfba5db8111ee9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1200051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbff0829aa54ba7e048eb88",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘最终弯道发动技能后\\n心中怀抱声援,速度少量提升\\n处于中山竞马场的话,速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc378a95e7c9eee49afe32f512ef232d31c717fb59fcb51e5611c0f721a34288",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:987b42541b007d47f39ca261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段在前方被逼近时\\n在终盘的最终弯道后半以及往后会提升速度\\n如果比赛距离为2400m～2500m\\n则额外向前稍微突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0160a0acb77d6ba810f1efc93a2aea20ad72290b3842cc0e72ceba6834d2e6af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374fae12e1dfbd2a3d26f147",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期位于前方时\\n若准备超越或者被逼近\\n则短时间内小幅向前突进\\n如果是英里比赛则短时间内大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "53665c8444d19d516ffe04a14fa26da510bb97080969b60395ad709084566d39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:146bb2b719164bc3e003164f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段发动技能时\n一段时间内速度提升\n若是根干距离的中距离比赛\n效果改变，一段时间内极大幅度向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "20da9d3baafd8d865c161523d0181d166ca64c1776b2630fc896371b77757ab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29e9cc2478d95587176504d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间点附近位于中团时提升速度\n若是英里比赛则大幅提升\n若是有马纪念赛道且粉丝数\n在146,738人以上则极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6efbe8223eb301f071b07751d423f0e0dff6054542c5c3bde8608934ac69f09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9f7509c356b0a1760f5e9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中距离或长距离比赛的最终弯道往后\\n在后方准备超越对手时速度提升\\n如果出闸时起跑慢了\\n变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b42ddda5b2ffc8684012a3a7dd623184ef40599d7951ae4550d40b2094948a08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b560b44590dfada54d1b98b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘迫近的某处位于中团时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度\n若是草地英里赛，则在持续一段时间内\n极大提升速度<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ab610618b216c230dc11f53ca1ae3acb2923ba0c02fd4624b56365ef25ab60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc96f3df799b12dd6e1eac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段位于中团\\n当试图超越或被接近时\\n在剩余,400,米处速度会提升\\n如果是非标准距离的比赛则会大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "9053418f7fae0e91caadeb710fcbf0755ce6ed647b3b4dbadf8d9170ca96183c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e4db571ae4341a91acdf1da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于前方时\\n根据剩余持久力展开长距离冲刺\\n速度持续性少量上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8e16183864083b89fb98218bdd94652cffbef9a727fe95288271a0d8598218",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cf8c45d57eadfccb1885ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的某个时刻若位于前方,则短时间内大幅\\n向前突进,若为中距离比赛且没有晚起步\\n之后会在终盘初段较早的某个时刻\\n短时间内提升加速度＜领放・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "db76732fd232fa98d182568476ba1194c1b6fc73bc26a9e796b56e05d43517ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6d83601a8be4b26cd17ebc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛事中盘初期在前列进行名次争夺时\\n速度提升＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7781fdb304bf269a26d576125b7abe23ac9d6b0a239b15bc5147028b5fa98a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ee328143cb6e0f1be338cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进行到中间位置若自身位于前方\\n则速度提升,若在长距离比赛前半段的弯道上\\n进行过竞争,则速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd58229452127ce67b35ef21c830146a587cfa415af20588e21e37c11ca41eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b4d0bcd4e0b8fc0ff12b5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入中盘后位于第一名或者是\\n位于前三名准备超越时\\n大幅回复耐力并小幅向前持续突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "15e1f8deabbb8b0a0e64ddb7f34c0600e737c2b08166d6ba3e6dbb123506da62",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf88cf6d998be34a99221ddd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘回复耐力\\n若是长距离比赛，随后在比赛后半段\\n位于中团时会持续向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1311da5e80bc8694b373beb296a0edf22fcf9d0bec1c4b27a2a2bcff9ecc7fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca1f9698f7c904efd2b6c50c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道位于前方时\\n速度提升,若是京都竞马场的\\n长距离比赛,则速度极大提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7edfdf2246f3020bc309a22c65e85503a1a5e06846b54d93ab1ed26e2750940",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b42dc537f5b7dd76f058b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘时若位于前方\\n则速度稍微提升\\n若是中距离比赛则之后\\n在中盘的直线处速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef4ae01274924aa3d7d27d188c0075ec50db4edb2b561feeb532c46db395598",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19dc12470f4e5f8eb1c80510",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道以及往后位于前方时\\n短时间内速度大幅提升,如果是\\n中距离比赛则改变效果\\n短时间内向前大幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bdc11df447ee0612a8d8e50bfc7bc7a2b6bd1d25574270e9b01f53b2841fb0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67b1984a208ba70eebc28c5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘在队伍中间位置超越过对手\\n则在第三弯道时短时间内提升速度\\n如果是2400ｍ的比赛且自身高人气\\n则持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c5b133f7720eedcf9d980d9381195b0bd8bac172e3551c4209443b6571b5b9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0aac815c9a143725ad01e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在中距离比赛的最终弯道\\n位于队伍中间,则向前突进\\n如果是东京竞马场的比赛\\n则大幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "894e7998edb423a10430def4d1a0dd0dc6afc0631b9732bdbf0379f29b78f858",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8077493834f615e85a75a31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛的半程左右若位于中间位置\\n则短时间内速度少量提升,之后若在终盘的弯道进行过竞争,则在剩余350m的位置短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "66cd63a78a5db9a30e1b0b244f41d834b7faf6e90d06ebd244da1ebb6e5ba4b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697e52ae8c32b152217ba0f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中间位置时若身处前方\\n一段时间内速度提升,若为短距离比赛\\n则一段时间内稍微向前突进＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b64ed1a9fd9e47f9f7f0ee381ee985f3cb09d983966b9a8cdba76159a24fc2fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729b59d3674aaa4052af52d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中盘的弯道处位于有利位置\\n则回复体力\\n若是中长距离比赛\\n则额外少量持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceb4b8fb384823b5dc6ad84d7280638466c2543b25c631c6dedc8c811e00583",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e99e14bbba5ebecaf64766",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段速度会提升\\n如果没有起跑失误并且保持在前方\\n速度会大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e3ab09488740fa6be3552f717e0d90b7eb7a6650017ff373fb6d1b26e92df65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3676526f3d1ef50d5ad5c1e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘以后在下坡路段处于中间集团，则下坡后将在较长时间\\n内持续小幅提升速度、极少量提升\\n加速力，效果期间发动技能3次\\n之内加速力会增加＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "944d8e61dc26d674d568a2389712d5ace165a6a0e42e4921c2567c2ca97cb346",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5808466587a9c59d951b3bf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的弯道位于后方时\\n若距离终点尚远则短时间内向前突进\\n如果是中山竞马场的中距离比赛\\n则提高效果量并额外提升微量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "962e9b06b4b02392a4ae906f11c0d2e07c369eed93728c64216a70ba2bfd4f78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3554d982607a953747ea76b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道及往后,自身位于中后方时\\n一段时间内速度大幅提升\\n若是中距离比赛则改变效果\\n一段时间内迅速向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b24c1526dc95b5f2a4576f719bdee8fb3706a8bb13159fce900131e80a7f47ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9b7db98c9e6bb000e0a315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛进入最后600m,并在队伍中间\\n从外道超越对手,则最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2db8f9a7cbf3f0c6cce70560d33686ed517e39a256d841976d76bcef8d46e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:775098e6d59329141bed6241",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处位于队伍中间时\\n速度少量提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd82de73cced2889a503992287cbbd30e75edfec184bc37d702de892e4f683e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd22519a2d5be6b2608c4ef3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "序盘以及中盘在前方被超越或进行竞争时\\n短时间内提升速度,若是长距离比赛\\n则在比赛后半段位于前二名时\\n速度少量持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d657770ff5e314ebd160bf845838f41ee29192a06271e0f1191e6f244195e6c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89cc7331988d2603c9516f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘后的最终直线上若位于队伍中间,则速度\\n提升,此外若是中距离或长距离比赛\\n且在中盘被超越过的话\\n稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2f8d74b6642f56aa71f36439e0c05ac646e9ab7676757c35ee6ee1cae2feb5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba920421669baf558a296744",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过技能回复3次以上耐力时\\n在紧临终盘前的位置向前突进\\n此外技能发动时若位于前方\\n则加速度稍微提升＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "940b12a4dbf948fec9c6a60f243821ea0daea0b41aceb7647612f9925829abca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "120771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227a68ff3bff408d4bd17369",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出赛状态若是为绝好调则所有基础能力提升\\n在比赛中不易受到技能的不利效果\\n并且比赛中加速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0c9f72099cea9142c99d403b0354587741b5e13420e6a5bfa07032827275f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f5e764a6e68f734dd0db30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "天气状况为晴且马场状况良好时\\n所有基础能力大幅提升\\n且比赛中加速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff651c794dc007e9f2061c59e59d20c67491d79c96c7b24b68083e2afaca37d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a397e5bfe8efd91b373f3b96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "天气状况为雨且马场状况不良时\\n速度与耐力超大幅提升\\n并且比赛中加速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "019e30f525d678e83d70909526c8a541bc63708aa441e0b92417092679a5edc8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551ad51b4fb671af5af78337",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若枠号为1～3,则出闸后的一段时间内\\n速度与加速度持续小幅提升；\\n在终盘时直线加速度小幅提升并回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13786d569e8acaa9c065ea97c5ac6e01010f47bf4d8570b4e6890dcad42e253",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d0990b53d17911cc6c3498",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若枠号为6～8,则速度、耐力\\n与力量超大幅提升；\\n在终盘时直线加速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ea764ea1a5eef6c942eb4a8cb988cde014753409d884817988557acc408e8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720bf9a7e1c120f52b867fe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛中队伍合计发动过6次以上技能\\n则终盘加速度小幅提升并回复持久力；\\n若发动过10次以上技能,本技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d57df03d2bf3f21dc7454b3d2fdf32e047424d884d6bdfa8f1e69d8c526c0fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08253045bff30ba67b1b3e6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时向前方大幅直线突进\\n同时恢复持久力,并且加速度小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4651bf290eb387dc7c5e5c384c953a9563ed7e56ff1c16b4802b38854268f204",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1300071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a183a8296047521b86a9c0a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺的关键时刻\\n速度大幅加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45ae78773ed10f3b4ac50b7bd0aa0c0b347b26253864644fa1c88a0c606eb97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c3d996d800c5b9c342f42d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时加速度会提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6abdb8dbf4c561832f3ca2214a64ffa88e141d1d5157541b647ff4153aa41de8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "1400021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d627897fa6bc04eed319e5f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会变得擅长顺时针赛道",
      "source_fingerprint": "36189735050687a2aeb544f2bc44406a2826749825ce8a20815129da88936620",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "200011"
      ]
    },
    {
